        "id": 5707
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-08-27T07:12:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So there are mixed views on that.  Some systems return something like error 206 (Partial Content), which is probably the closest return code to match this scenario (although not a perfect match).  The problem is that this would probably confuse a much of existing clients for keystone who aren\u0027t expecting it.  I\u0027m open to ideas on was we could indicate this, however.",
